RT02Qu5I_9rQoyvLmVxQUNbWSs1YeqqYzhAW_fFATuXGXTUKQAcR-iZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKKy9wO2b77L6Iu6GsK-cGej3It3n1hBC607ploIo1yrQ&oe=6ABBC432"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "wmremove-transformed.png", "id": "1700508307791861", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_1700508311125194_508308047262333852_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JnmkdhUh4MAQ7kNvwGHTcCc&_nc_oc=Adr2s2oDePdsQq1PYjAtanEPNleyF7BWO0sxo4S27wy4QVRan82zmVhb9k9Gj4xHX18&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKJ4eEA3m_hBtp-wHwYnaucatWdo267yLh2jIn5-1IXFA&oe=6ABBC907"}, "display_name": "Cleaning Simulator VR", "keywords": ["cleaning", "powerwash", "relaxing", "simulation", "simulator"], "long_description": "# \ud83e\uddfd The Ultimate VR Cleaning Experience\nSome people find peace in meditation. You're about to find it in a filthy room and a pressure washer.\n\n## \ud83e\uddfc Clean Your Way\nPick your weapon:\n* \ud83d\udca6 **Power Wash** \u2013 Point, squeeze, watch years of grime just vanish\n{2557483701390539}\n* \ud83e\uddf9 **Broom** \u2013 Old school, but there's something about sweeping that just hits\n{899137776119647}\n* \ud83e\udee7 **Soap & Scrub** \u2013 Foam it up, scrub it down, see your reflection in it\n{931330130011429}\n* \ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f **Garbage Collection** \u2013 Somebody's got to haul it out, and today that's you\n{1522415972438018}\nEverything moves the way your hands expect it to. That's the whole trick, and it's why you'll keep playing longer than you planned.\n\n## \ud83c\udf0d Interactive Environments\nEvery room is a disaster waiting to happen, in the best way possible.\n* Poke at, pick up, and move basically anything\n* Dirt that reacts to what you're actually doing\n* Real progress you can see as you work\n* A rhythm that's honestly hard to put down\n\nYou'll look up and realize an hour's gone. It happens.\n\n## \ud83d\udc65 Living World\nYou're not doing this alone. Sharky's hanging around, tossing you the occasional job and pulling pranks the second you let your guard down. He's chaotic, he's interactive, and he's absolutely going to mess with you while you work.\n{2260685611358503}\n\n## \ud83d\ude80 Constant Updates\nWe're not done. Not even close.\n**New stuff drops every 2 weeks:**\n* New places to clean\n* New tools to mess with\n* New challenges\n* Smoother performance\n* Gameplay tweaks based on what you tell us\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Grab a pressure washer, a broom, or a soapy sponge and go to work. Blast grime off walls, sweep up the mess, haul out the trash, and hang out with Sharky along the way. Turns out cleaning is way more fun when it's not your house."}]}, "developer_name": "OneLight Interactive", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.onelightinteractive.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "OneLight Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.onelightinteractive.com/cleaning-simulator", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27458175390459393"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1107439101625406_7139046290807357433_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_